From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:43:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 061/111] Column block highlight follows visual columns across
 tabs

A tab cut by the left or right edge of a column block was drawn either
outside the highlight or wholly inside it. The highlight is now drawn by
visual columns: only the part of such a tab that lies inside the block is
highlighted, and the bar of a zero-width block inside a tab sits at its
column, matching where typing and copying act.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

